  "protocol": "# v3 retraining protocol (written 2026-10-16, before any v3 result was computed)\n\nGoal: higher precision of habitat-formation alerts without losing the honest-evaluation chain of v2.\n\n1. Features, labels and tuned hyper-parameters are those of v2 (outputs/v2/tune.json). No re-tuning on later data.\n2. Candidates (scripts/v3_retrain.py `candidates`):\n   R0 static fit (v2 equivalent); R1 refit every 28 d; R2 refit every 14 d; R3 refit every 28 d with 3 seeds per learner;\n   R4 refit every 28 d with the alternative feature set (h7: no weather/S2; h14: with weather/S2).\n3. Selection uses ONLY rolling forecasts on the v2 validation window, 2025-01-01..2025-08-31.\n   Each refit sees outcomes with date <= origin - h - 2. Rule: highest validation PR-AUC.\n4. Evaluation: chosen candidate, rolling from 2025-01-01 to the last labelled date. Calibration (isotonic),\n   the best-F1 threshold, the high-precision threshold (lowest threshold with precision >= 0.75 and >= 30 calls)\n   and the conformal pool (last 120 d) are re-estimated at every origin from EARLIER out-of-sample forecasts only.\n   Reported window: 2025-09-01 onwards, with test (to 2026-01-26) and forward (after) sub-windows,\n   against B1 (WATER_FREQ_30D) and the frozen v2 models on identical rows, 500-draw spatial block bootstrap.\n5. Caveat stated in every write-up: Feb-Sep 2026 was blind for v2, not for v3 (its v2 scores were known).\n6. Operational model: chosen candidate refit on every labelled row; recalibration from the last 365 d of OOS forecasts.\n",
